To make any career truly "soft," it usually comes down to three key factors rather than just the job title:
Location and Time Freedom. The ability to work remotely, set your own hours, or avoid a draining daily commute.
Clear Boundaries. Roles where you are judged on your output and results rather than being micromanaged or expected to stay online late.
Sustainable Pace. Work environments that respect rest, offer predictable workloads, and do not rely on constant high-stress emergencies.
